    m_Untranslated: "The Sample Scene contains numerous Networked Mini Game examples.\n\nThese are the areas we will explore in this tutorial:\n\xB7  Low Level prefab for Mini Games\n\xB7  Climbing Mini Game\n\xB7  Whack A Pig Mini Game\n\xB7  Slingshot Mini Game"
